  pm-rl-yi7j,parent,"2026-08-10T23:31:12.522Z","harness:claude-code","cli:update:dep",detected
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-11T04:34:16.897Z",pi-agent,"Extracted the JSON_SPEC_FENCE const (one shape, no g flag) replacing five inline regexes. Renamed isEnvironmentInvalidated to environmentInvalidationReason returning string|null with distinct wordings: 'environment was edited' (hash mismatch), 'environment specification is unreadable' (no fence), 'environment has no recorded specification identity' (no affected_version), 'environment could not be resolved' (absent/read failure), null for the seed's empty env. buildLineageAncestry now takes a ReadonlyMap<string,string> of own reasons and renders the reason. Tests updated: ghost env asserts 'could not be resolved', noHash asserts 'no recorded specification identity', noFence asserts 'unreadable'."
